00:26:28.000 --> 00:27:13.000
And I'm staring at this wall of the window of the bus at the Kalandaya checkpoint and six million ghosts chase me as we drive through. And I wonder if they will ever rest. Aaron Davidman performing an excerpt from his play, Wrestling Jerusalem. Hidden Brain is produced by Karam Agar Kalasin, Maggie Pennman and Max Nestrak. Special thanks this week to Ari Roth at Mosaic Theatre and Aaron Davidman for sharing an excerpt from their play. You can follow us on Facebook, Twitter and Instagram. You can listen to my stories on your local public radio station. If you like this episode, please consider giving us a review on iTunes.
